<title>USA: FSA said it qualifies Gresham-Barlow, Ore. issue.</title>
<headline>FSA said it qualifies Gresham-Barlow, Ore. issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSA said it qualified Gresham-Barlow School District #10, Ore., $32 million of general obligation bonds for insurance.</p>
<p>The issue is slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
